# Line endings, repo wide.
#
# This repo is worked on from a Windows laptop with core.autocrlf=true and from
# a Mac that now holds the beta server. A shell script that arrives on the Mac
# with carriage returns fails as "bad interpreter" or as a command not found on
# the last word of every line, neither of which names the real cause, so the
# person reading it goes looking for a broken toolchain instead of a line
# ending. Two lines here make that impossible for the whole class.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
